{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34256","headline":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶竈 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美茶具十咏 茶竈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无突抱轻岚，有烟映初旭。\n盈锅玉泉沸，满甑云芽熟。\n奇香袭春桂，嫩色凌秋菊。\n炀者若吾徒，年年看不足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}